 Sportscore?", "correctOption": "B", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "It sells its products only online."}, {"label": "B", "content": "It manufactures its shoes in Nazret."}, {"label": "C", "content": "It will be moving its main offices soon."}, {"label": "D", "content": "It was the first shoe company in Ethiopia."}]}, {"questionNumber": 166, "content": "What is suggested about the Jumjum and Longa Web sites?", "correctOption": "B", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "They sell only handcrafted goods."}, {"label": "B", "content": "They receive orders from around the world."}, {"label": "C", "content": "They offer free shipping to London and New York."}, {"label": "D", "content": "They are planning to open retail stores."}]}, {"questionNumber": 167, "content": "In which of the positions marked [1], [2], [3], and (4] does the following sentence best belong? \"The city boasts four garment factories, with a fifth scheduled to be built this year in nearby Wonji.\"", "correctOption": "C", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "[1]"}, {"label": "B", "content": "[2]"}, {"label": "C", "content": "[3]"}, {"label": "D", "content": "[4]"}]}]}, {"groupCode": "QG-168-171", "groupTitle": "Text-message chain: cover design", "passageText": "[SOURCE PAGE 18]        Gary Park (10:23 A.M.)              I e-mailed you the cover design for our September issue a few minutes ago.         Did you receive it?             Jill Riley (10:26 A.M.)           Yes, but is this the latest version? I thought we agreed that the background           color should be lighter so the article titles are more visible.        Gary Park (10:28 A.M.)              I forgot-sorry about that! I'm just now sending the file with the most recent            version.             Jill Riley (10:30 A.M.)         Opening it now ... That's more like it. I'll forward it to Graphics and request           a sample printout.             Jill Riley (10:35 A.M.)        Good morning, Mr. Ojeda. Our new cover design is ready. When do you           think you'll have a chance to work on it?        Frank Ojeda (10:38 A.M.)         Send it to me now. I'll have a print copy ready for your approval after lunch.                0", "questions": [{"questionNumber": 168, "content": "Where do the people most likely work?", "correctOption": "D", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "At a bookstore"}, {"label": "B", "content": "At a public library"}, {"label": "C", "content": "At a television studio"}, {"label": "D", "content": "At a magazine publisher"}]}, {"questionNumber": 169, "content": "Why does Mr. Park apologize?", "correctOption": "A", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "He sent the wrong file."}, {"label": "B", "content": "He used an old e-mail address."}, {"label": "C", "content": "He missed a project deadline."}, {"label": "D", "content": "He lost an important document."}]}, {"questionNumber": 170, "content": "At 10:30 A.M., what does Ms. Riley most likely mean when she writes, \"That's more like it\"?", "correctOption": "B", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "The budget is more reasonable."}, {"label": "B", "content": "The color looks better."}, {"label": "C", "content": "The story is more interesting."}, {"label": "D", "content": "The schedule is more realistic."}]}, {"questionNumber": 171, "content": "What will Mr. Ojeda do by the afternoon?", "correctOption": "B", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "Approve a marketing plan"}, {"label": "B", "content": "Produce a sample"}, {"label": "C", "content": "Repair a printer"}, {"label": "D", "content": "Make copies of an agreement"}]}]}, {"groupCode": "QG-172-175", "groupTitle": "Letter: Small Business Challenge finalist", "passageText": "[SOURCE PAGE 19]   8 February   Ms. Mala Chelvi   60 J alan Tun Razak   54200 Kuala Lumpur   Dear Ms. Chelvi,  We are delighted to inform you that you have been nominated as a finalist for the   Small Business Challenge competition this year. Now in its fifth year, this   competition is designed to highlight innovative products and services launched by   young entrepreneurs. The Web application that you developed, which provides a   means of matching charitable organizations with volunteers, earned one of the top    scores from our panel of judges.   In the next round of the challenge, you will participate in a live presentation about   your product before a panel of expert judges. The three people with the best   presentations will receive one-time grants of MYR 10,000 each to invest in their    businesses.   Please go to sbc.org/competition and submit an outline of your presentation, a brief   video that clearly illustrates the use of your application, and a passport-sized   photograph of yourself. You will also need to sign a consent form allowing us to use   your name and photo, if needed, in promotional materials on our Web site. The   deadline for submission of these materials is 10 March.   Best regards,  FclMv PCf.A!lfY   Felix Pang   Chairperson, Small Business Challenge Committee", "questions": [{"questionNumber": 172, "content": "What is the purpose of the letter?", "correctOption": "B", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "To seek volunteers for an event"}, {"label": "B", "content": "To notify a contest finalist"}, {"label": "C", "content": "To sell business consultation services"}, {"label": "D", "content": "To offer a small-business loan"}]}, {"questionNumber": 173, "content": "What does Ms. Chelvi most likely specialize in?", "correctOption": "B", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "Law"}, {"label": "B", "content": "Technology"}, {"label": "C", "content": "Finance"}, {"label": "D", "content": "Marketing"}]}, {"questionNumber": 174, "content": "The word \"illustrates\" in paragraph 3, line 2, is closest in meaning to", "correctOption": "A", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "represents"}, {"label": "B", "content": "translates"}, {"label": "C", "content": "lightens"}, {"label": "D", "content": "decorates"}]}, {"questionNumber": 175, "content": "What is Ms. Chelvi asked to do by March 10?", "correctOption": "C", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "Update a Web page design"}, {"label": "B", "content": "Give a presentation"}, {"label": "C", "content": "Sign a consent form"}, {"label": "D", "content": "Pay a fee"}]}]}, {"groupCode": "QG-176-180", "groupTitle": "E-mail and receipt: McMann Home Furnishings", "passageText": "[SOURCE PAGE 20]                  riedewald@ parasur.net.sr   To:         I                       client services@ mhf.ca   From:       I                     April 2, 12:21 P.M.   Date:       I   Subject:       Your feedback              I   Dear Mr. Riedewald,                        w   Thank you for filling out the McMann Home Furnishings (MHF) survey. To show our    appreciation, we have added reward points to your account. They can be applied to the   purchase of products offered online as well as those offered in our retail stores. Clearance    items and those priced $15.00 and above may not be purchased using credits.   To use your reward points for an online purchase, select the items you would like to   purchase and then check out. At the bottom of the page, select \"Apply credits.\" The value   of the applied credits will appear on your order receipt as a special discount.    If you would prefer to use reward points at one of our retail locations, you can do so by   logging in to your account on our Web site. Go to the My Rewards page, and then select    \"Print as a coupon.\" The coupon will have a bar code that can be scanned at the store's   checkout counter.   Sincerely,   Client Services, McMann Home Furnishings                                                   iYl                            Online Order #1157                      McMann Home Furnishings Store                 M   h 19 11 31 A M", "questions": [{"questionNumber": 176, "content": "According to the e-mail, how did Mr. Riedewald receive reward points?", "correctOption": "B", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "He won an online contest."}, {"label": "B", "content": "He participated in a customer survey."}, {"label": "C", "content": "He spent a certain amount of money."}, {"label": "D", "content": "He returned an item."}]}, {"questionNumber": 177, "content": "In the e-mail, the phrase \"filling out\" in paragraph 1, line 1, is closest in meaning to", "correctOption": "C", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "emptying"}, {"label": "B", "content": "supplying"}, {"label": "C", "content": "completing"}, {"label": "D", "content": "expanding"}]}, {"questionNumber": 178, "content": "How can customers apply their reward points in an MHF retail store?", "correctOption": "C", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "By entering their account number"}, {"label": "B", "content": "By entering their phone number"}, {"label": "C", "content": "By scanning a coupon's bar code"}, {"label": "D", "content": "By going to the Client Services Department"}]}, {"questionNumber": 179, "content": "According to the receipt, what is true about Mr. Riedewald?", "correctOption": "D", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "He paid for delivery of the items."}, {"label": "B", "content": "He purchased the items in the evening."}, {"label": "C", "content": "He paid over $70 for all items combined."}, {"label": "D", "content": "He purchased only one item at regular price."}]}, {"questionNumber": 180, "content": "What item did Mr. Riedewald most likely purchase using reward credits?", "correctOption": "A", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "The picture frame"}, {"label": "B", "content": "The ceramic mug"}, {"label": "C", "content": "The floral blanket"}, {"label": "D", "content": "The photo album"}]}]}, {"groupCode": "QG-181-185", "groupTitle": "Letter and order: Two Swan Press", "passageText": "[SOURCE PAGE 22]                                Two Swan Press                               72 Holywell Road, Edinburgh EH8 8PJ           4 December           Mr. Albert Morello            17 Peyton Avenue           Kingston 5            Jamaica, W.I.           Dear Mr. Morello:           Enclosed please find your royalty payment for Understanding Our Oceans. You should           have recently received an e-mail that listed the sales figures and the royalties due to           you for the print and electronic versions of your book.        We are proud to announce that Two Swan Press was given the Publisher of the Year          Award by the UK Book Industry in October. We thank the authors who have worked           with us since our founding five years ago.           All Two Swan Press authors are entitled to an author discount of 40 percent off any                title on our Web site. Simply use the code AUX1417 for your discount.                 If you have any questions at all, please do not hesitate to contact me.          Kind regards,           Set¥cilrv           Sarah Wicklin             Encl.", "questions": [{"questionNumber": 181, "content": "What is a purpose of the letter?", "correctOption": "C", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "To ask Mr. Morello to write a book"}, {"label": "B", "content": "To explain an enclosed contract"}, {"label": "C", "content": "To notify Mr. Morello of a payment"}, {"label": "D", "content": "To describe an updated personnel policy"}]}, {"questionNumber": 182, "content": "What was sent in a previous message to Mr. Morello?", "correctOption": "B", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "Incorrect contact information"}, {"label": "B", "content": "Detailed sales numbers"}, {"label": "C", "content": "A list of suggested changes"}, {"label": "D", "content": "A link to an electronic book"}]}, {"questionNumber": 183, "content": "What does Ms. Wicklin mention about Two Swan Press?", "correctOption": "C", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "It moved to a new location in October."}, {"label": "B", "content": "It has launched a new program for its fifth anniversary."}, {"label": "C", "content": "It has won an industry award."}, {"label": "D", "content": "It has decided to focus on scientific publications."}]}, {"questionNumber": 184, "content": "What is suggested about Mr. Booth?", "correctOption": "A", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "He is a Two Swan Press author."}, {"label": "B", "content": "He wrote Business in Our Lives."}, {"label": "C", "content": "He is an acquaintance of Mr. Morello."}, {"label": "D", "content": "He has purchased items from Two Swan Press before."}]}, {"questionNumber": 185, "content": "What is indicated about the order?", "correctOption": "C", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "It has been delayed."}, {"label": "B", "content": "It has not yet been paid."}, {"label": "C", "content": "It contains multiple books."}, {"label": "D", "content": "It includes free shipping."}]}]}, {"groupCode": "QG-186-190", "groupTitle": "E-mail, application, and newsletter: Mentoring Program", "passageText": "[SOURCE PAGE 24]   To:                   II All Staff                                                       I   From:        II Personnel Department                                            I   Date:               ll June 20   Subject:       Mentoring Program                   II                                                               I  Attachment: II @AJ2J2lication                                                   I   Employees who have been with Broadside Electronics for less than eighteen months are    invited to apply to participate in a new mentoring program that will match a maximum of    ten junior employees with long-term company veterans. The goal is that junior employees    will sharpen corporate skills, better understand company culture, and develop a more   focused career path. Mentees will be assigned to a mentor based strictly on their work   assignment and professional interests. The pairs will meet at mutually convenient times   throughout the year, from three to five hours per month.   To be considered for participation in this initiative, complete the attached application and    return to Mentoring Program Director Tim Wrigley at t.wrigley@broadsideelec.com by   July  I. Mr. Wrigley will send notification of his selections by July 15.             MENTO RING PROGRAM APPLICATION    Name: Cora Drummond          Extension: 144                                                                                            .::....:..-=----     Division: Sales         =-===-------     Professional areas of interest:       I am most interested in learning about our markets abroad and developing   my sales-presentation abilities for these international markets. I am also[SOURCE PAGE 25]The Broadside Company Newsletter            Mentoring Program Sees Results            Long-time employee and Vice President of Sales Alena Russo was              intrigued when a Personnel Department director approached her             about mentoring a less experienced employee under a program that            began last year. She is glad to have accepted the assignment. \"After            working with Ms. Drummond, I am more satisfied with my own               duties, because I know I have helped a professional who is just              getting started. I only wish that I had had someone looking out for          me in my early years,\" remarked Ms. Russo.           Ms. Drummond explains that she \"needed pointers on how to make               better sales pitches.\" She reports that her sales are up by 20 percent             now. She better understands the opportunities Broadside Electronics             has to offer and what is required to become a manager. \"Thanks to            Ms. Russo, I have been able to define my career goals, and I am a             happier person when I arrive to work every day.\"          New mentorship pairs are now being formed. Interested parties             should contact Tim Wrigley in the Personnel Department.186. What does the e-mail indicate about the        189. What is most likely true about Ms. Russo?     mentoring program?                                                                (A) She is planning to retire soon.      (A)  It is popular industry-wide.                         (B) She has international sales experience.      (B) The number of participants is limited.             (C) She has mentored many junior      (C)  It is designed for staff in the sales                    employees.            division.                                         (D) She recently joined the hiring team.      (D) Participants must attend an orientation", "questions": [{"questionNumber": 186, "content": "What does the e-mail indicate about the mentoring program?", "correctOption": "B", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "It is popular industry-wide."}, {"label": "B", "content": "The number of participants is limited."}, {"label": "C", "content": "It is designed for staff in the sales division."}, {"label": "D", "content": "Participants must attend an orientation meeting."}]}, {"questionNumber": 187, "content": "How will the junior employees most likely be selected?", "correctOption": "C", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "They will be chosen from a management-training group."}, {"label": "B", "content": "They will undergo competitive interviews."}, {"label": "C", "content": "They will be evaluated by Mr. Wrigley."}, {"label": "D", "content": "They will be recommended by a local business school."}]}, {"questionNumber": 188, "content": "What is suggested about Ms. Drummond?", "correctOption": "A", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "She has worked at Broadside Electronics for less than eighteen months."}, {"label": "B", "content": "She has just transferred from another department."}, {"label": "C", "content": "She has received a positive annual review."}, {"label": "D", "content": "She has made many successful presentations abroad."}]}, {"questionNumber": 189, "content": "What is most likely true about Ms. Russo?", "correctOption": "B", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "She is planning to retire soon."}, {"label": "B", "content": "She has international sales experience."}, {"label": "C", "content": "She has mentored many junior employees."}, {"label": "D", "content": "She recently joined the hiring team."}]}, {"questionNumber": 190, "content": "What benefit from the mentoring program have both Ms. Drummond and Ms. Russo enjoyed?", "correctOption": "A", "options": [{"label": "A", "content": "Increased job satisfaction"}, {"label": "B", "content": "Quick promotions"}, {"label": "C", "content": "Paycheck bonuses"}, {"label": "D", "content": "Clearer career goals"}]}]}, {"groupCode": "QG-191-195", "groupTitle": "Web site, online form, and e-mail: Runkle Fencing", "passageText": "[SOURCE PAGE 26]       [ https://www.runklefencing.co.uk                                              18                      Temporary                                                   Residential       Home                                                            Commercial        c--\"'                 I                                I                                                I    Temporary Fencing Service    Need a temporary fence installed at your residence, workplace, or special event? Our     expert team will deliver and install chain-link fencing on the booked date and time.   When the fence is no longer needed, we will take it down and haul it away. Like our      residential and commercial fencing, our temporary fences are obtained from the best     manufacturers using the finest materials. Our fences have a tidy, sturdy, professional     appearance that local residents and businesses appreciate. We also see to all legally     required inspections and certifications.    Ready for a price quote? Contact us today via our Online Quote service. Be sure to     provide the following information so we can provide an accurate estimate:      1. The preferred height of your fence (Be aware that local regulations commonly       allow a maxim